shen.clj

Shen 41.2 running on Clojure.

To run, execute:

	./bin/shen

or, from a standalone jar:

	java -Xss16m -jar shen.clj-0.2.0-SNAPSHOT-standalone.jar

Requires a JDK and the Clojure CLI (https://clojure.org/guides/install_clojure).

Written by Håkan Råberg (hakan.raberg@gmai.com), feedback welcome.
https://github.com/hraberg/shen.clj
